<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7099" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναξηρ-αίνω</span></b> , fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ᾰνῶ</span>: aor.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνέξηρᾱνα,</span>
		
			Ion.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ηνα,</span>
		
			Ep.
		
		subj.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγξηράνῃ</span>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dry up,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡς δ᾽ ὅτ᾽ ὀπωρινὸς Βορέης . . ἀλωὴν
					αἶψ᾽ ἀγξηράνῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					21.347
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ὑποζύγια ἀρδόμενα ἀνεξήρηνε
				[τὴν λίμνην</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.109
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
			</span></i><i>Aër.</i><i><span class="en">
				8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phylarch.
				50
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.511
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<i>consume, exhaust,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἶκον ἀ. ὀδόντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Call.
					<u>Cer.</u>
					114
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>dry again,</i> after bathing, in 
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Acut.</u>
				65
			</span></i>.</div>
